# KQM Vodyanitsa quick guide, Hydro Traveler team: Albedo E N1 > Mona Q
# N1 > Vodyanitsa E > Mona N1 E N1 > Traveler hE (full hold) N1C >
# (Vodyanitsa Q / Traveler Q), as written. The guide: Vodyanitsa can
# burst every rotation, or alternate her burst with the Traveler's; so
# she bursts when ready, and the Traveler when she cannot.
active albedo;
albedo skill, attack;
mona burst, attack;
vodyanitsa skill;
mona attack, skill, attack;
travelerhydro skill[hold=1], attack, charge;
if .vodyanitsa.burst.ready {
  vodyanitsa burst;
} else if .travelerhydro.burst.ready {
  travelerhydro burst;
}
